{"seq":2,"slug":"audience-personalization-routing","title":"人群分流与落地页个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/landing-experiment-personalize/audience-personalization-routing","wordCount":2027,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"人群分流与落地页个性化\">人群分流与落地页个性化</h1><p>把同一条落地页给所有人看，是把「用户已经告诉我们的信息」浪费掉。当广告已经携带了受众分层（再营销、相似人群、兴趣定向）、地域、设备、以及点击时携带的意图信号时，落地页完全可以在渲染时使用这些信息把首屏换成更可能命中的版本。本篇讲个性化的三个工程支柱——分流、决策时机、隐私边界——以及它们各自的失效模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分流-互斥与稳定键\">核心概念：分流、互斥与稳定键</h2><p>个性化与实验共用一套分流基础设施，因此必须先解决一个前提：<strong>同一用户不能同时落入互相冲突的处理组</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"互斥与分层\">互斥与分层</h3><p>两类需求必须区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互斥</td>\n<td>保证用户只落一个变体</td>\n<td>同一个实验的 A/B 两组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层（正交）</td>\n<td>保证多个实验互不干扰</td>\n<td>首屏实验与表单实验并行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层实现的方式是给每个实验分配独立的哈希盐（salt），用同一用户标识分别计算各层的桶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>bucket</mtext><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>salt</mtext><mi>L</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bucket}_L(u) = \\text{hash}(\\text{salt}_L \\,\\|\\, u) \\bmod N_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bucket</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">salt</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同盐让不同层的分组近似独立，从而多个实验可以并行而不互相污染。若两个实验需要严格互斥（例如都改首屏），则把它们的盐设为同一个，用桶区间切分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"稳定键的选择\">稳定键的选择</h3><p>分流键决定了同一用户是否总是看到同一版本。可选键的性质差异很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分流键</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>跨设备</th>\n<th>隐私影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一方 Cookie 中的匿名 ID</td>\n<td>高（同一浏览器）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需同意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端会话 ID</td>\n<td>中（会话内）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告点击 ID（gclid/fbclid）</td>\n<td>低（每次点击不同）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>属广告标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登录用户 ID</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需身份与同意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对落地页，务实的选择是<strong>第一方匿名 ID 优先，缺失时降级到会话 ID，并在分析时记录降级比例</strong>。降级比例过高会让跨会话的个性化（如再营销内容）失效，这是一个应当被监控的指标。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function assign(expId, salt, userId, fallbackSessionId) {&#10;  const key = userId || fallbackSessionId;&#10;  const degraded = !userId;&#10;  const buf = await crypto.subtle.digest(&#39;SHA-256&#39;, new TextEncoder().encode(`${salt}:${expId}:${key}`));&#10;  const bucket = new DataView(buf).getUint32(0) % 10000; // 万分桶&#10;  return { bucket, degraded };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">salt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fallbackSessionId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallbackSessionId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> degraded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.subtle.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHA-256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">salt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUint32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 万分桶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { bucket, degraded };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>万分桶（0–9999）而非百分比整数，是为了在分层时能切出细粒度区间，例如「实验 A 用 0–4999，实验 B 用 5000–7499」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策时机-边缘-服务端与客户端\">决策时机：边缘、服务端与客户端</h2><p>个性化必须在某个时刻被解析为具体内容，而时机决定了它能用到哪些信号以及代价多大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种时机对比\">三种时机对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策位置</th>\n<th>可用信号</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>缓存影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CDN 边缘（middleware）</td>\n<td>请求头、Cookie、Geo、URL</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>需 <code>Vary</code>，可能降低命中率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用服务端</td>\n<td>上述 + 用户档案、库存、价格</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>页面不可共享缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端（浏览器）</td>\n<td>上述 + 设备能力、视口</td>\n<td>无额外网络</td>\n<td>首屏可能闪变（CLS 风险）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"边缘决策的价值与约束\">边缘决策的价值与约束</h3><p>边缘中间件在缓存之前执行，因此它能对静态生成的内容做个性化而不牺牲整体架构。Vercel 的 Routing Middleware 文档对这一点的描述是：因为它「runs globally before the cache」，所以是给静态生成内容提供个性化的有效方式，可以在请求进入时执行自定义逻辑、重写、重定向、加头 <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/routing-middleware\">Routing Middleware</a>。同页给出的关键限制包括：最大 URL 长度 14 KB、请求体 4 MB、请求头最多 64 个且总长 16 KB；并且它对数据库的访问若跨区域会产生显著延迟，文档建议使用全局存储产品。</p>\n<p>对落地页的具体含义是：<strong>边缘层适合做「选哪个变体」这类轻量决策，不适合做「查库存与个性化价格」这类需要往返数据库的决策</strong>。后者应当放到应用服务端。</p>\n<h3 id=\"客户端个性化的闪变问题\">客户端个性化的闪变问题</h3><p>客户端根据条件替换首屏内容，会导致 CLS 恶化，也可能出现「先显示默认版再换成个性化版」的闪烁。规避方式是为个性化区域预留稳定高度（或先用骨架占位），或把个性化下沉到边缘/服务端。若必须客户端决策，应当在首个渲染帧之前完成（同步脚本内联于 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>），代价是增加阻塞体积；这与性能预算直接冲突，见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/landing-speed-mobile-webvitals\">落地页极速加载与移动 Web Vitals</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[广告点击请求] --&gt; B[CDN 边缘 middleware]&#10;  B --&gt; C{信号足够决策?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[重写到变体路径&lt;br/&gt;加 Vary 头]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[透传到应用服务端]&#10;  E --&gt; F[查用户档案/库存/价格]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; G[返回 HTML]&#10;  G --&gt; H{个性化区需客户端替换?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[预留高度 + 保持骨架]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[直接渲染]&#10;  I --&gt; K[监控 CLS]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[广告点击请求] --&gt; B[CDN 边缘 middleware]\n  B --&gt; C{信号足够决策?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[重写到变体路径&lt;br/&gt;加 Vary 头]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[透传到应用服务端]\n  E --&gt; F[查用户档案/库存/价格]\n  F --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; G[返回 HTML]\n  G --&gt; H{个性化区需客户端替换?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[预留高度 + 保持骨架]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[直接渲染]\n  I --&gt; K[监控 CLS]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"个性化的规则表达\">个性化的规则表达</h2><p>个性化逻辑不应当散落在模板里，而应当被表达为可审计的规则集。这既是可维护性要求，也是合规要求——你需要能回答「这个用户为什么看到了这个版本」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_set&quot;: &quot;lp-onesie-personalize&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 12,&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;retargeting-viewed-product&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;audience&quot;: &quot;retargeting_30d&quot;, &quot;has_viewed_product&quot;: true },&#10;      &quot;then&quot;: { &quot;hero&quot;: &quot;dynamic_product&quot;, &quot;cta&quot;: &quot;resume_cart&quot;, &quot;proof&quot;: &quot;recent_reviews&quot; },&#10;      &quot;requires_consent&quot;: [&quot;ad_storage&quot;, &quot;ad_personalization&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;market-local-trust&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;market_in&quot;: [&quot;DE&quot;, &quot;AT&quot;, &quot;CH&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;then&quot;: { &quot;proof&quot;: [&quot;certification_local&quot;, &quot;return_policy_local&quot;] }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;low-intent-value-first&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;audience&quot;: &quot;interest_prospecting&quot; },&#10;      &quot;then&quot;: { &quot;hero&quot;: &quot;category_value&quot;, &quot;cta&quot;: &quot;browse_collection&quot;, &quot;proof&quot;: [&quot;review_count&quot;] }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;fallback&quot;: { &quot;hero&quot;: &quot;default_product&quot;, &quot;cta&quot;: &quot;shop_now&quot;, &quot;proof&quot;: [&quot;review_count&quot;] }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lp-onesie-personalize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"retargeting-viewed-product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"audience\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"retargeting_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"has_viewed_product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"then\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hero\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dynamic_product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"resume_cart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"proof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recent_reviews\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"requires_consent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ad_storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ad_personalization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"market-local-trust\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"then\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"proof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"certification_local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_policy_local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low-intent-value-first\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"audience\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"interest_prospecting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"then\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hero\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"browse_collection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"proof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hero\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default_product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shop_now\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"proof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得注意：<code>requires_consent</code> 让规则在同意缺失时自动降级到 fallback 而不是被静默跳过；<code>fallback</code> 保证任何未命中规则的用户仍有完整页面；<code>version</code> 让规则变更可以被实验与报表关联（与同意日志的 <code>banner_version</code> 是同一思路，见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/landing-privacy-cookie-consent\">Cookie 横幅/隐私同意与转化平衡</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私边界\">隐私边界</h2><p>个性化天然要使用用户数据，因此它同时受两个约束：<strong>同意范围</strong>与<strong>跨境数据流动</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"同意范围决定可用信号\">同意范围决定可用信号</h3><p>再营销类个性化的前提是用户此前与该品牌有过交互，这类标识通常存储在需要同意的存储中。因此在 <code>ad_personalization</code> 或 <code>ad_storage</code> 被拒绝时，再营销规则必须降级——这不是可选的工程细节，而是合规要求。前文的 <code>requires_consent</code> 字段就是这条约束的载体。</p>\n<p>匿名化信号（市场、设备类别、URL 参数）的约束更弱，但它们也需要注意组合后的可识别性：小市场 + 稀有设备 + 精确时间戳的组合可能具备准标识符的性质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨境数据流动\">跨境数据流动</h3><p>个性化决策往往需要在边缘或服务端读取用户档案，而档案可能存储在与用户所在地不同的区域。此时需要考虑数据驻留要求。可行的架构是：<strong>把个性化所需的特征最小化到可缓存的、区域化的形态</strong>（如「该用户属于 30 天再营销人群」这一个布尔值），而不是把完整档案复制到边缘。</p>\n<h3 id=\"个性化的度量与因果\">个性化的度量与因果</h3><p>个性化效果不能用「个性化组 vs 未个性化组」直接比较，因为两组人群本身不同（选择了不同的规则意味着不同的画像）。正确做法是<strong>在同一人群内部做随机化</strong>：对命中同一条规则的用户随机分配「应用规则」与「显示默认版」，比较两组差异。这与常规 A/B 实验的统计要求一致，见 <a href=\"landing-ab-mab-experiment\">落地页 A/B 与多臂老虎机实验</a>。</p>\n<p>一个常见的失败是拿「再营销受众看个性化页」与「冷启动受众看默认页」比较，然后得出个性化提升显著的结论——这测的是受众质量差异，不是个性化效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>个性化把落地的「一对多」变成「对得上」，但它引入的复杂度必须被显式管理。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分层与互斥要分清</strong>：不同盐做正交分层，同盐切区间做互斥。</li>\n<li><strong>分流键要稳定</strong>：第一方匿名 ID 优先，降级比例必须被监控，否则跨会话个性化静默失效。</li>\n<li><strong>决策位置决定成本</strong>：边缘适合轻量选择，服务端适合需要档案与库存的决策，客户端决策要防 CLS。</li>\n<li><strong>边缘中间件有硬限制</strong>：URL 14 KB、请求头 64 个、跨区域数据库访问延迟高。</li>\n<li><strong>规则要可审计</strong>：用显式规则集表达，含 <code>requires_consent</code> 与 <code>fallback</code>，并记录版本号。</li>\n<li><strong>同意状态是硬门槛</strong>：<code>ad_personalization</code> 被拒绝时再营销规则必须降级，不是可选优化。</li>\n<li><strong>效果测量必须在人群内随机化</strong>：跨人群比较测的是画像差异，不是个性化效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：个性化与实验都要求发布足够快，见 <a href=\"landing-builder-cms-publish\">落地页建站/CMS 与快速发布</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人群分流与落地页个性化","id":"人群分流与落地页个性化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分流、互斥与稳定键","id":"核心概念-分流-互斥与稳定键"},{"level":3,"text":"互斥与分层","id":"互斥与分层"},{"level":3,"text":"稳定键的选择","id":"稳定键的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"决策时机：边缘、服务端与客户端","id":"决策时机-边缘-服务端与客户端"},{"level":3,"text":"三种时机对比","id":"三种时机对比"},{"level":3,"text":"边缘决策的价值与约束","id":"边缘决策的价值与约束"},{"level":3,"text":"客户端个性化的闪变问题","id":"客户端个性化的闪变问题"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化的规则表达","id":"个性化的规则表达"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私边界","id":"隐私边界"},{"level":3,"text":"同意范围决定可用信号","id":"同意范围决定可用信号"},{"level":3,"text":"跨境数据流动","id":"跨境数据流动"},{"level":3,"text":"个性化的度量与因果","id":"个性化的度量与因果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"落地页 A/B 与多臂老虎机实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/landing-experiment-personalize/landing-ab-mab-experiment"},"next":{"title":"落地页建站/CMS 与快速发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/landing-experiment-personalize/landing-builder-cms-publish"}}